WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.257
Today we will coordinate movement with music. Our work connects with our own local

00:00:05.257 --> 00:00:05.619
community.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.245
Choose two safe steps that suit the chosen rhythm.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.181
Connect them with a pause and a change of direction.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.885
Perform the phrase twice with control and enough personal space.
